in Game/Data/feud_rules_793.json. Her nerve is the stat as it stands, marks and all. Their men: the boat that is out, or the men in the lender''s yard.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"30c1d876-9e10-4e09-b1bb-2e3db9604ed2","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":640.0,"yMin":330.0,"xMax":1260.0,"yMax":440.0},"title":"What the answer does","body":"A card''s chance takes it as its \"by\": each point over 3 adds a twentieth to the card''s own odds, each point under 3 takes one off. The odds themselves are in the cards (encounters/wokerer_793.json).","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"71a4f357-5d76-4475-8f38-92db23fbf6a0","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}}'
